#. ID 41, Page 1, Line 1, Pos (17,7)
msgid ""
"Black tiles represent pictures that will lead to\n"
"a crash on RPG_RT (either due to an invalid\n"
"pixel format error or stream read error).\n"
"EasyRPG also do not display a picture."
msgstr ""
"Les cases noires indiquent les images qui vont\n"
"causer un plantage sur RPG_RT (soit à cause d'une\n"
"erreur de format pixel ou de lecture du flux).\n"
"EasyRPG n'affiche pas une image."

#. ID 41, Page 1, Line 5, Pos (17,7)
msgid ""
"Grey tiles represent pictures that lead to a crash\n"
"on RPG_RT, but that can be displayed in EasyRPG.\n"
"White tiles are tests that pass on EasyRPG."
msgstr ""
"Les cases grises indiquent les images qui vont\n"
"causer un plantage sur RPG_RT, mais pouvant être\n"
"affichées sur EasyRPG. Les cases blanches sont les\n"
"tests qui passent sur EasyRPG."

